        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Telehealth-guided self-palpation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No marked focal tenderness, guarding, or rigidity described; mainly epigastric discomfort / pressure. No direct physical examination performed."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Tarsal tunnel symptoms, left ankle / foot"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing medial ankle / foot tingling and burning by the end of shifts, consistent with the prior diagnosis. Some improvement with brace and orthotics; still flares when on registers too long. No new weakness or change in baseline paraesthesia pattern."
      }
    },
    {
